          "modified": "2026-10-12T09:07:18+04:00",
          "message": "Dear Students, Hope you are well. Assessment Quiz 1 is now open on the LMS and must be completed by Tuesday, 20th October. Please attempt it in good time so that any technical issues can be resolved before the deadline. If you have any questions, please get in touch. Best, Navneet"
